OL,3,GNEWSANo timescale for demolition of
OL,4,AGreenock homes built with unsafe Raac
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents affected by the planned
OL,7,Fdemolition of flats in Greenock that
OL,8,Fwere found to contain potentially
OL,9,Fdangerous concrete have said they are
OL,10,Fno further forward with a timescale or
OL,11,Fsupport following a meeting with a
OL,12,Fhousing provider.
OL,14,FThe properties, on Belville Street,
OL,15,Fcontain Raac - reinforced autoclaved
OL,16,Faerated concrete - and River Clyde
OL,17,FHomes (RCH) has said seven blocks have
OL,18,Fto be knocked down.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
