OL,3,GNEWSANo timescale for demolition of
OL,4,AGreenock homes built with unsafe Raac
OL,5,
OL,6,FA meeting was held on Tuesday but
OL,7,Fresidents said they did not get the
OL,8,Finformation they wanted about what
OL,9,Fwould happen next and what support
OL,10,Fthere would be.
OL,12,FAn RCH spokesman said: "While there are
OL,13,Fstill important discussions and
OL,14,Fconsiderations ahead, River Clyde Homes
OL,15,Fis committed to continuing positive and
OL,16,Fconstructive dialogue with homeowners."
